{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"8572665a-14e6-4cbc-9f85-704882b069a2","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam India Track","slug":"colosseum-crypto-worlds-fair-hackathon-superteam-india-track","description":"\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Superteam India\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSuperteam India is a community of founders, developers, and operators building on Solana. We connect talent with opportunities and back builders with grants and bounties. Indian teams have consistently won at Colosseum hackathons, with 6 teams also making it to the Colosseum Accelerator and receiving a $200k Investment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrack Scope\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThis is a local prize pool for India-based teams competing in Colosseum's Crypto World's Fair.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eBuild for the global hackathon, submit there, and this listing pays out the best Indian submissions on top of anything you win globally. The hackathon is multichain, but this pool is for Solana projects only.\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eBuilt on Solana\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eTeam based in India\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eRegistered on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003eColosseum\u003c/a\u003e with \"India\" selected as your country\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSubmitted to both the Colosseum portal and Superteam Earn\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eEligible under the \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.colosseum.org/hackathon#faqs\"\u003eofficial global rules\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eEcosystem Impact: real value to Solana through infrastructure, tooling, or a product people need\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eProduct-Market Fit: a clear problem, a defined user, and early signs of traction\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eGrowth Potential: brings new users to Solana or deepens engagement among existing ones\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRewards\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e🥇 First Prize: $2500\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e🥈 Second Prize: $1500\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e🥉 Third Prize: $1000\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eAdditionally, all winners will receive a \u003cstrong\u003eMember role in Superteam India.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow to Enter\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eRegister on \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003eColosseum\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSubmit your project to the Colosseum portal by October 12.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003eSubmit it here on Earn as well.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003chr\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResources\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003col class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/worldsfair\"\u003eCrypto World’s Fair Hackathon\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/\"\u003eColosseum\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/copilot\"\u003eColosseum’s Copilot Agent\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://superteam.fun/hackathon\"\u003eSuperteam’s Hackathon Hub\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","commitmentDate":"2026-10-28T18:29:59.000Z","eligibility":[{"type":"text","order":1,"optional":false,"question":"Project Name"},{"type":"text","order":2,"optional":false,"question":"Project Description"},{"type":"link","order":3,"optional":false,"question":"Project Github Link"},{"type":"link","order":4,"optional":true,"question":"Project Website"},{"type":"link","order":5,"optional":true,"question":"Project X Link"},{"type":"link","order":6,"optional":false,"question":"Link to your pitch deck or Loom/video presentation"},{"type":"text","order":7,"optional":false,"question":"Did you submit this project to the official Frontier Hackathon on Colosseum? (Yes/No)"},{"type":"link","order":8,"optional":false,"question":"Link to Colosseum project"},{"type":"link","order":9,"optional":f